## chrono-node

Adapted in:

- `src/search/enDate/constants.ts` — weekday and month tables, number and
  ordinal word tables, time-unit tables, year pattern and parsing helpers,
  and the duration connector grammar.
- `src/search/enDate/parsers.ts` — the regular expressions and extraction
  rules of the English parsers (ISO 8601, year-month-day, slash dates,
  month-name forms, weekdays, clock times, relative offsets, casual words).
- `src/search/enDate/refiners.ts` — the refiner pipeline and merge rules.
- `src/search/enDate/timezones.ts` — the timezone abbreviation table and the
  daylight-saving rules for zones whose offset varies.

